OL,3,AJohn Healey giving first major speech
OL,4,Aas chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is giving his
OL,7,Ffirst major speech since taking on the
OL,8,Frole in July - watch live above
OL,10,FHe says UK businesses are ready to
OL,11,F"seize the opportunity of new tech" and
OL,12,Fthat there's been an increase in
OL,13,Fproductivity after decades of lagging
OL,14,Fbehind other countries
OL,16,FHealey's expected to unveil a #150m
OL,17,Ffund for fast-growing companies in the
OL,18,Fnorth of England
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
